<h1>Bill Conway</h1>
<p>34th Ward alderman, on the Chicago ballot February 23, 2027. Incumbent.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.newdayconway.com/" rel="nofollow noopener">Campaign site (newdayconway.com)</a></p>
<h2>Running on</h2>
<p>Launched a re-election bid in July 2026, ending speculation about a mayoral run. His stated priorities are keeping neighborhoods and public transit safe, expanding funding for mental health and homelessness services to address root causes of crime, and holding the line on property taxes.</p>
<h2>Background</h2>
<p>34th Ward alderman since 2023; Navy veteran and former Cook County prosecutor.</p>
